                <pb facs="0973" n="965" xml:id="pg965"/>

                <head>Participation of the United States in the Fourth International (Diplomatic)
                    Conference on Private Air Law, Brussels, September 19–30, 1938<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="comp18-f1"/></head>
                <p>[For proceedings of the Conference, resolutions adopted, text of proposed
                    conventions (not ratified by the United States) and other pertinent documents,
                    see Department of State Conference Series No. 42: <hi rendition="#italic">Fourth
                        International Conference on Private Air Law … Report of the American
                        Delegation to the Secretary of State</hi> (Washington, Government Printing
                    Office, 1939).]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
